Logs.Reasoning:
Accepted strings are either  
1) exactly five letters with no digit or ‘#’ and the first letter is not ‘m’;  
2) any string of length ≥ 6 that contains at least one digit or ‘#’;  
3) any string that contains the substring “my” and, after that, a non‑digit followed immediately by a digit or ‘#’ (with any characters before, between or after).  
All negative examples violate one of these three conditions.
